{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first of seven chapters of a courtroom battle style visual novel, in which the story follows brand new lawyer Samuel Prince as he solves a strange variety of different crimes. Acquire evidence by investigating the crime scene, then use it in court when cross examining witnesses to cleave through all the lies and find your way to the truth. Use your head to point out contradictions between the testimony and the facts in order to get your client declared innocent and deliver justice to those who really deserve it. In this chapter, Samuel Prince makes his grand debut in the courtroom, defending a young college girl accused of killing her best friend.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Chapter 1 Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950150/81adb1f418b131e37711a60f9e6f0ddf98b31c26.jpg"},{"name":"I'm Too Tired For This","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950150/822a1abf146499a4ff11a6752ff24af0798778a3.jpg"},{"name":"Rough Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950150/ae0804c9ab10c69af9c37ca08ef9a05f9e73712f.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950150?t=1772144345","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950150/49ea1a00e3d7bb775fafd89549d3a182bc32bde8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772144345","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950150/ecf8fc010c95548f6fe95df9134f015674eaf51f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772144345","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950150/ecf8fc010c95548f6fe95df9134f015674eaf51f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772144345","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descri